Package: xbox-wireless-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, python3-cairo,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-evdev, upower,
 polkitd | policykit-1, udev, systemd, bluez
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-utils, evtest, joystick
Description: GTK4 interface for the Xbox Wireless Adapter (xone/xow)
 Manage the Xbox Wireless Adapter and controllers on Linux: pairing,
 controller battery via UPower, LED, poweroff, rumble, audio/headset,
 Bluetooth, live button tester, diagnostics, notifications and a CLI.
 .
 The package includes a udev rule, a dedicated xboxwireless group, a
 polkit helper and optional background service.
